OL,3,AChurch leads tributes for man killed at
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, his church said:
OL,7,F"Pastor Robert was a faithful servant
OL,8,Fof God, a loving husband to Isay, a
OL,9,Fdevoted and caring father to Ellie, and
OL,10,Fa blessing to so many people whose
OL,11,Flives he touched. His life, his faith,
OL,12,Fhis love, and his service to God will
OL,13,Fnever be forgotten."
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
