OL,3,AManhunt after woman, 22, killed and
OL,4,Afive injured in Swiss shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA manhunt is under way after a
OL,7,F22-year-old woman was killed and five
OL,8,Fothers injured in a shooting which
OL,9,Freportedly took place at a rave in
OL,10,Fnorthern Switzerland.
OL,12,FThe woman died at the scene, police
OL,13,Fsaid. Those injured were four men and a
OL,14,Fwoman aged between 24 and 27, all of
OL,15,Fwhom are in hospital with injuries
OL,16,F"ranging from minor to severe".
OL,18,FThe force confirmed the shooting
OL,19,Fhappened at an event at a horse racing
OL,20,Ftrack in Aarau, near Zurich overnight.
OL,21,FA rave was taking place in the area
OL,22,Finto the early hours of Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
